WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:03.190
(laughs)

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.023
- Hey, guys.

00:00:04.023 --> 00:00:05.990
Right at the outset I have to tell you

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:07.330
Bear is okay.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.410
He's doing well.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.490
Come on, little puppy.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.089
Good boy.

00:00:11.089 --> 00:00:14.120
(laughs) Look at his giant face.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:14.953
Clean your face,

00:00:14.953 --> 00:00:15.786
you're on camera.

00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:17.180
He isn't going traveling.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.070
This isn't his neck pillow.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.530
This is his anti-lick-his-incision pillow.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.750
Basically, he can't turn
around all the way with this

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.910
'cause it's so big.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.840
And if he wants to lick
himself he just can't.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.640
He's been wearing this for the last week.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.910
He's pretty comfy with
it and used to it by now.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.870
But what I'm gonna do is I'm
gonna take it off for the video

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:34.910
'cause I can watch him right now

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.370
and make sure he doesn't lick anything

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.090
that he's not supposed to except me.

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:40.630
The surgery that he had was,

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:41.560
you may have guessed it.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.600
He was neutered.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.240
Snip snip for poor little Bear.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:47.450
There is a few reasons why I
decided to get Bear neutered,

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.070
but that wasn't an easy decision.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.830
I actually went back
and forth a few times.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:51.663
First of all,

00:00:51.663 --> 00:00:53.460
Bear has a snaggle tooth.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:54.880
I don't know if anyone has seen it.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:57.010
He has this snaggle tooth
and I was kind of worried

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.900
if it would bother him long-term.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:00.420
So I thought

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.180
let's do two birds with
one stone type situation.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.400
Get him neutered,

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.820
and while he's under anesthesia

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.490
they can A, clean his teeth,

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:09.160
and B, get the tooth out.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.090
However,

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.200
when this little guy
went under anesthesia,

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.570
they did x-rays

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:17.030
and they found that he
has an extra canine tooth.

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.970
Bear, you have three canines.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:19.803
If you're wondering,

00:01:19.803 --> 00:01:23.090
the canine tooth is this
bottom tooth right here.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.090
The big one.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:27.470
And he literally has an extra
one that's growing outward.

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:28.890
When the doctor did the x-rays,

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.920
it seemed like the roots
were so interconnected

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.010
with all the other teeth,

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:35.760
that by taking it out

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.960
there may be damage
done to the other teeth.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.380
She was worried about that.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.290
So she explained that
since he's eating well,

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.123
there's no pain,

00:01:42.123 --> 00:01:43.090
there's no discomfort,

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:44.760
they decided to keep the tooth in.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.180
So Bear is still having his three canines.

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:51.330
The pros to neutering
a dog really come from

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:55.080
A, it changes their behavior
for the better slightly

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.030
for male dominant dogs,

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.650
there's decreased marking,
decreased humping,

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:01.870
decreased reaction to females in heat.

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.840
Bear didn't have any
of those really issues.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.600
I mean occasionally, when
he would see a female dog,

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:06.700
he would get really excited.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.280
He's not aggressive in anyway.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.170
He's super friendly.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.400
Then I started looking and doing research

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.540
on what would be the pros from
a health standpoint for Bear.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.990
I have to say at the outset
of this I'm not a vet.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.180
I am a medical doctor,

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.980
although some people have gotten
that confused in the past.

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:23.359
Roxy.

00:02:23.359 --> 00:02:25.330
(woman speaking Italian)

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.000
The things that I found were
mainly from quality research.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.920
And speaking with some really
experienced dog trainers,

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:32.390
veterinarians, things like that.

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.250
So if you're thinking
about neutering your dog,

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.280
don't neuter your dog simple because

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.980
your dog is doing something
that you don't like

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:40.550
and you think that's gonna be a cure-all.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.750
Train your dog.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.030
I think for controlling the
pet population in general

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:44.863
it's a good idea,

00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:46.750
but you shouldn't be
using it as a cure-all

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:47.860
for some behavioral issue

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.050
unless it's specifically
recommended to you

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.280
by a veterinarian

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:54.370
and/or a trained behavioral
specialist for dogs.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.730
Now Bear never really had any issues.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.820
He was attacked one time
and that's a crazy video.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:02:59.930
I'll link that down below.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:01.220
But in general he's a happy Newf,

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.800
he loves playing with other dogs.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.260
Lately, I haven't been
letting him play with dogs

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.670
because I'm trying to get him
ready for his certification

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.090
to come with me to the hospital.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.980
And we want Bear to be
well-trained for that.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:12.310
So I haven't been letting him play

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:13.970
with too many puppies in the dog park.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.940
Mostly just Roxy when she comes to visit

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.020
or he goes to visit her.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:19.990
There's a lot more health
benefits for spaying a female dog

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:21.603
than neutering a male dog.

00:03:21.603 --> 00:03:24.610
There are decreases in
some cancers for male dogs

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:26.400
like testicular, prostate issues.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.510
But in reality,

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.990
not too many health benefits.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:31.410
There are certain studies going around

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:34.410
saying that dogs who are
neutered live longer.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.103
I take those studies with a grain of salt

00:03:36.103 --> 00:03:37.870
because dogs that have been neutered

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.620
generally get better veterinary care,

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.230
they have owners that
are attentive to them.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:42.920
It's no surprise that they live longer.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.510
At least there is evidence

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.920
that they don't live a shorter live

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.327
because some people have said that.

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:49.197
"Oh my god, your gonna
take away the testosterone.

00:03:49.197 --> 00:03:51.280
"That means dogs are gonna
live a shorter life."

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.113
That's not true.

00:03:52.113 --> 00:03:53.460
We have evidence of that at least.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.480
My main reason why I wanted to neuter Bear

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.330
is if I travel and I'm
gone for a day or two,

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:03.640
and I leave Bear with my dad or a friend,

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:07.540
I don't want the possibility
or Bear becoming a baby daddy.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.720
- [Maury] You are the father!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.400
- And I don't want to
pay doggy child support

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.974
when he impregnates a little chihuahua.

00:04:13.974 --> 00:04:14.807
- Hey, hey, hey.

00:04:14.807 --> 00:04:16.780
- So we got Bear fixed
primarily for that reason.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.620
He's doing great after the operation.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.090
He's like a happy Newf.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:21.128
He's healing well.

00:04:21.128 --> 00:04:23.550
(Bear hiccups)

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.928
