having hiccups on my lap.

00:04:34.807 --> 00:04:36.757
(Bear hiccups)
He has hiccups.

00:04:36.757 --> 00:04:38.920
(Bear hiccuping)

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.560
Growing pups always have hiccups.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:41.393
That's not new.

00:04:41.393 --> 00:04:43.511
So that doesn't even concern me.

00:04:43.511 --> 00:04:48.178
(Bear hiccups)
(laughs)

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.260
If you have any questions

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.140
about what it's like to
get your dog neutered,

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.770
